<h1>Property Tax Levies</h1>
<p>Issues 4 through 40 include 36 property-tax levies. Issue 10 is the Conneaut charter amendment, not a levy.</p>

<span class="verification-badge">Verified 2026-10-11 against Ashtabula County BOE official issues list</span>

<h2>Tax changes (11)</h2>
<p>These are new taxes, increases, or a reduction. The rest are straight renewals.</p>

<table class="levies">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Issue</th><th>Jurisdiction</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Type</th><th>Millage</th><th>Est. Cost per $100K</th><th></th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for levy in levies %}
    {% if levy.tax_change %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ levy.issue_number }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.jurisdiction }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.purpose }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.type }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.millage }}</td>
      <td>{% if levy.annual_cost_per_100k %}${{ levy.annual_cost_per_100k }}/yr{% else %}See BOE{% endif %}</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox" data-worksheet-id="levy-{{ levy.issue_number }}-yes" data-worksheet-label="Issue {{ levy.issue_number }} ({{ levy.jurisdiction }} {{ levy.purpose }}): YES" aria-label="Vote yes on Issue {{ levy.issue_number }}"></td>
    </tr>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>Straight renewals (25)</h2>
<p>These continue existing taxes at the same rate. They do not add a new levy or change the levy rate.</p>

<table class="levies">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Issue</th><th>Jurisdiction</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Millage</th><th>Term</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for levy in levies %}
    {% if not levy.tax_change %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ levy.issue_number }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.jurisdiction }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.purpose }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.millage }}</td>
      <td>{{ levy.term_years }} years</td>
    </tr>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

